  "question": {
    "text": "The plane which bisects the line segment joining the points <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> at right angles, passes through which one of the following points?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "The midpoint of line joining the given points is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>  and it lies on the required plane.<br/><br/>Normal to the plane, the line joining the given points, has direction ratio <math><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>≡</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>⇒</mo></math>  equation of plane is  <math><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math> <br/><br/>Hence plane passes through point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
  }
}